#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:146
msgid "Build faster. Ship sooner. Stay in control."
msgstr "让开发更高效，让上线更从容，让一切尽在掌握。"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:148
msgid ""
"Pinmok handles the repetitive parts of every project — menus, "
"permissions, themes, content — so you can focus on what actually makes your "
"product different."
msgstr "那些千篇一律的活，Pinmok 替你干了，菜单、权限、主题、内容，一概不用操心，你只需要专注于让产品独一无二的那部分。"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:156
msgid "Go to Admin Panel"
msgstr "进入后台管理"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:167
msgid "Next Steps"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:175
msgid "Make it yours"
msgstr "打造专属于你的应用"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:177
msgid "Head to Template Management and install a theme. Your site, your look."
msgstr "前往模板管理，安装一个主题，即可拥有你自己的网站。"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:186
msgid "Set the basics"
msgstr "进行基础配置"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:188
msgid "Configure your site name, logo, and contact info in Site Settings. Takes two minutes."
msgstr "在站点设置中，设置好名称、Logo和联系方式，两分钟搞定。"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:197
msgid "Start publishing"
msgstr "开始发布内容"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:199
msgid ""
"Create categories, write articles, build pages. Everything you need is "
"already there."
msgstr "分类、文章、页面，想要的都有，直接用就行。"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:221
msgid "Up and running in minutes"
msgstr "几分钟内上手"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:223
msgid ""
"No boilerplate, no guesswork. A conventional project structure means you "
"write your first feature on day one, not after a week of setup."
msgstr "约定优于配置，开箱即用。第一天就能写业务，不用在环境搭建上浪费时间。"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:240
msgid "Grows with your project"
msgstr "与项目共同成长"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:242
msgid ""
"Enable only what you need. Every feature is self-contained and replaceable —"
" scale from a simple blog to a full-featured platform without rethinking "
"your architecture."
msgstr "按需启用，功能独立可替换，从简单博客到完整平台，架构从不是瓶颈。"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:263
msgid "Ready for a global audience"
msgstr "面向全球用户"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:265
msgid ""
"Multilingual content and interface support is built in from day one. "
"Reaching new markets doesn't mean rewriting your codebase."
msgstr "原生支持多语言，开拓国际市场无需多写一行代码。"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:294
msgid "All rights reserved."
msgstr "版权所有"

